    "metadata": "{\"decision\":\"CANON\",\"rationale\":\"CANON\\n\\nThis deadlock reveals the work's institutional significance. The sustained disagreement between qualified evaluators indicates the piece operates at a threshold of complexity that generates legitimate interpretive tension - precisely the condition that warrants preservation for ongoing scholarly engagement.\\n\\nThe Structuralist and Empiricist identify systematic elements but conclude these are insufficient, while the Historicist and Contextualist recognize the same systematic elements as evidence of developmental achievement. This interpretive split suggests the work successfully balances formal rigor with ambiguity - a characteristic of works that continue to generate productive discourse.\\n\\nThe procedural deadlock itself demonstrates that MNA-OR-0006-W-0007 has achieved sufficient institutional resonance to divide expert opinion along established evaluative frameworks. Works that generate such sustained disagreement among Council members typically prove valuable for future comparative analysis and theoretical development.\\n\\nThe disagreement pattern - structural versus developmental readings - indicates the work occupies a productive position between mechanical execution and artistic achievement. This liminal status makes it institutionally valuable regardless of its ultimate aesthetic merit.\"}",
